        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 542,
      "author": {
        "id": 5140
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T16:21:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the updates to the `(1)` patch to make `SkUnicode::Make()` always exist, this `#ifdef` can now be removed. And maybe `SK_UNICODE_ICU_IMPLEMENTATION` and `SK_UNICODE_ICU_IMPLEMENTATION` can be removed (or at least not be public defines).",
      "parentUuid": "5a6effe7_aac1d1e5",
      "revId": "49b0dca6e9eb0e619899b8a8369bbc850c5aee6c",
